SUMMARY:World Cup Watch Party with Futbol828
DESCRIPTION:June 11 @ 3:00 pm – 10:00 pm\n\nKick off the World Cup at The MuleWe’re teaming up with our friends at Futbol828 for an unforgettable afternoon. Whether you’re a fan of the sport or simply ready to dance\, enjoy great food and make connections\, you won’t want to miss this one! The big screen will be home to the Mexico v. South Africa game while local vendors line our turf outside and soccer mini games fill the yard\, all set to the sounds of local live musicians [TBA]. Futbol828 invites you to take your best shot in the Penalty Kick Shoot Out\, and we’ll wrap the whole evening with a Latin dance party hosted by Metzil Designs.\nThis event directly supports Futbol828 in their efforts to expand their youth leagues.\n\n\nDoors & Watch Party: 3pm \nPK Shoot Out Tourney: 5pm Register for the shootout! \n8-10pm: Dance Party \n\n  \n\n\n‘The Mule’ – Tasting Room \n\n\n\n\n\nSay hello to The Mule – a full-service bar/event space in the home of Devil’s Foot Beverage’s production facility. Draft soda\, beer\, & wine – as well as delicious cocktails & mocktails featuring Devil’s Foot craft sodas and the largest collection of NC-made spirits in Asheville – all at your fingertips just outside of Biltmore Village! Open now for all of your beverage & party needs! devilsfootbrew.com/the-mule
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/world-cup-watch-party-with-futbol828/
LOCATION:The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages\, 131 Sweeten Creek Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/707189515_122290239758019470_3105371261734943380_n-e1780480627304.jpg
GEO:35.5588369;-82.5218977
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages 131 Sweeten Creek Road Asheville NC 28803 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=131 Sweeten Creek Road:geo:-82.5218977,35.5588369
END:VEVENT
